{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pint Sized is a co-operative drink-serving simulation platformer revolving around the jobs of Coco and Hazel: two squirrels down on their luck working to pay rent on their tree. They must work together to effectively fulfil customers orders, splitting the tasks of grabbing glasses, pouring pints, and swiftly serving between both players.  <br><br>From the homely feel of the Greyfur Pub to the scorching sun of Tailgown Tiki, and a crazy cruise with Admiral Almond, there will plenty of bars, obstacles, and mechanics to face and master to become the World Best Squirrel Barkeeps\u2122.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/extras/67cdc2da17210746f50b82f45485944f.poster.avif?t=1772908773\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/extras/67cdc2da17210746f50b82f45485944f.webm?t=1772908773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/extras/67cdc2da17210746f50b82f45485944f.mp4?t=1772908773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Coco and Hazel to serve drinks in a variety of levels, each with their own challenges to discover and overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/extras/5d9a9e4e9b0a1d5810696e5cbeb0fbd2.poster.avif?t=1772908773\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/extras/5d9a9e4e9b0a1d5810696e5cbeb0fbd2.webm?t=1772908773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/extras/5d9a9e4e9b0a1d5810696e5cbeb0fbd2.mp4?t=1772908773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab two drinks and mix them into one tasty pint to earn more nuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/extras/4ac75792a5a0abdd54adb99ef10319a9.poster.avif?t=1772908773\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/extras/4ac75792a5a0abdd54adb99ef10319a9.webm?t=1772908773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/extras/4ac75792a5a0abdd54adb99ef10319a9.mp4?t=1772908773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Get creative to overcome obstacles and keep the drinks flowing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834270?t=1772908773","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834270?t=1772908773","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/430b3d1a7ac44fe07e10b584063352d933b27166/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772908773","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834270/430b3d1a7ac44fe07e10b584063352d933b27166/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772908773","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camer